// =====================================================
// PACKAGES API
// =====================================================

### Get All Packages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages

### Get Packages - Domestic Only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages?tag=domestic

### Get Packages - International Only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages?tag=international

### Get Featured Packages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/featured

### Get Featured Packages - Limit 3
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/featured?limit=3

### Get Women-Only Packages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/women-only

### Get Women-Only Packages - Domestic
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/women-only?tag=domestic

### Get Group Departure Packages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/group-departure

### Get Group Departure Packages - International
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/group-departure?tag=international

### Get Package by ID (Replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/packages/YOUR_PACKAGE_ID_HERE


