// =====================================================
// FORMS API - MESSAGES
// =====================================================

### Submit Contact Message - Valid
POST http://localhost:5000/api/user/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "emailAddress": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+91-9876543210",
  "subject": "Inquiry about Dubai Package",
  "message": "I would like to know more details about the Dubai luxury package. What are the accommodation options available?"
}

### Submit Contact Message - Invalid Email (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/user/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Smith",
  "emailAddress": "invalid-email",
  "phoneNumber": "+91-9876543210",
  "subject": "Test Subject",
  "message": "Test message"
}

### Submit Contact Message - Missing Required Fields (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/user/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "emailAddress": "test@example.com"
}


